es-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 3% of normal in February to March and 138% in April to May. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 15110 got 22% of normal that year.</p>"}
